{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0403_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f94a29e913206aa7004e15ee10cfb7e9e8927ece14d6cbf8198998aa8a95fd62", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の企画で、\n今夜は千鶴さんがスパイに扮して撮影に挑戦する！）", "zh": "（在写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的企划中，\n今晚千鹤要扮成间谍挑战拍摄！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0403_1001_038chz", "source_sha256": "c07ab299afdb2d789faafade2c7c3d0700c6a26d2ae20868a8e1cd524af8f68b", "ja": "……{$P$}？\n{$P$}！　どこを見ていますの？", "zh": "……{$P$}？\n{$P$}！　您在看哪里呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0403_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4297b75fdcde2c811fb9c9076cb705930fe1ae19249c5b40bba2018f7cb7d484", "ja": "ハッ！　千鶴さん！？\nビックリしたぁ……いつからそこに？", "zh": "哈！千鹤小姐！？\n吓我一跳……您什么时候来的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0403_1003_038chz", "source_sha256": "faf0101c3128a37bc2d46d850fce10bc3197ee3a8f7bcdbf53c86f3eab44416d", "ja": "ふふっ、つい先ほどでしてよ♪　どうやらわたくしにも\nスパイの才能があるようですわね。", "zh": "呵呵，刚才才到这里♪看来我似乎也有当间谍的才能呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0403_1004_p", "source_sha256": "dbd3565e975f6d495e74a745f448281d326660ff7b5cc8151b531d2abcec7fb4", "ja": "ああ。視線を惹きつける華やかさを出すことも、\n反対に、世を忍ぶこともお手の物……。", "zh": "啊啊。无论是展现吸引视线的华丽气场，还是反过来隐藏身份，都得心应手……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0403_1005_038chz", "source_sha256": "9f1d132d8d96c67feba16df5e59af5734df907f954973fd6b9e07e967bc035ad", "ja": "わたくしはセレブであり、アイドル……。いかなる時も\n己の存在感を自在に操れなければいけませんわ。", "zh": "我既是名媛，也是偶像……无论何时，都必须能够自如地掌控自己的存在感才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0403_1006_038chz", "source_sha256": "cb89e3b26e3dd0dc66bb317e356c7ea766e60afca585f606e494ff99122cb062", "ja": "場や空気を見極め、ふさわしい振る舞いを心がける。\nそれは、スパイであっても同じことですわ。", "zh": "审时度势，时刻注意举止得体。\n这一点就算换作间谍也是一样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0403_1007_p", "source_sha256": "7f8c16278f6d25a233f1357adf56991222dc929a00672025d49902ec1625bd6b", "ja": "なるほど……。\nちなみに、何かコツとかあるんですか？", "zh": "原来如此……顺便问一下，有什么诀窍之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0403_1008_038chz", "source_sha256": "6482df4b3ed7e68a363e7c6566c7fc101f5bfbdb3829e8c4455a5effa47f2fc8", "ja": "そうですわね……どんな場所でも周りを\nよく観察することでしょうか。", "zh": "是这样呢……无论身处何地，都要仔细观察周围吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0403_1009_038chz", "source_sha256": "ee1ee3dd1c02a87ce23e7c821baad9d1068a7758c58393ecbb077ff121df5255", "ja": "自分が場に馴染んでいるか、考えながら行動するだけで\nずいぶん違ってくると思いますわ。", "zh": "我觉得，只要一边考虑自己是否融入了场合一边行动，就会大不一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0403_1010_038chz", "source_sha256": "019056fea39cd6f4be03e14312655a599511d9c144f23ecdd93b73f5db833348", "ja": "そうすれば、商店街でも……。\n……ふぅ。", "zh": "这样一来，在商店街也……  \n……呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0403_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1a11d75fb9dc9d41ac7932d9969e00313be802b8cf4fed4f9b285600a369597f", "ja": "千鶴さん？", "zh": "千鹤？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0403_1012_038chz", "source_sha256": "aa47938b6fb34f36ca285ae70b3dceefcdfe2a1175339e3cc763cc18cffc3593", "ja": "そう。考えながら行動すれば……セレブなわたくしも、\n商店街のような場所に馴染むことが出来るのです。", "zh": "没错。只要一边思考一边行动……即使是身为名媛的我，也能融入商店街那样的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0403_1013_038chz", "source_sha256": "3a29dad0bec788bf7d28d66bedb534f20feeded2fd3fd815a4631e938c1c9899", "ja": "{$P$}。この後の撮影も、\n華麗なるスパイの活躍にご期待くださいまし♪", "zh": "{$P$}。也请期待接下来的拍摄中，华丽间谍的精彩表现♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0403_1014_038chz", "source_sha256": "de7149c73f4765eb600ca0b65c81338b97f2e917de35e2b2b149f3abe053c00b", "ja": "時に大胆に、時に静かに行動するスパイ……\nわたくしが完璧に演じてみせましてよ！", "zh": "时而大胆，时而悄然行动的间谍……\n我会完美地诠释这个角色的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
